{
  "id": "24722_kurikkusuru",
  "headword": "クリックする",
  "reading": "くりっくする",
  "romaji": "kurikkusuru",
  "part_of_speech": "suru verb",
  "gloss": "to click (a mouse button or link)",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to click (a mouse button or link)",
      "explanation": "To press and release a mouse button, or to tap/select a link or button on a digital interface."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "24722_kurikkusuru_ex1",
      "japanese": "ここをクリックしてください。",
      "english": "Please click here.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "24722_kurikkusuru_ex2",
      "japanese": "リンクをクリックすると{別|べつ}のページが{開|ひら}く。",
      "english": "When you click the link, a different page opens.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "24722_kurikkusuru_ex3",
      "japanese": "{間違|まちが}えてそのボタンをクリックしてしまい、データが{消|き}えてしまった。",
      "english": "I accidentally clicked that button and the data was deleted.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "From English \"click.\" One of the most common computer-related loanword verbs in Japanese. Used with する to form a verb.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ダブルクリックする: to double-click\n- {右|みぎ}クリックする: to right-click\n- リンクをクリックする: to click a link\n- ボタンをクリックする: to click a button\n- クリックして{開|ひら}く: to click and open\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- タップする: to tap — used for touchscreens rather than mouse input\n- {押|お}す: to press — the native Japanese word for pressing buttons, but not used for mouse actions\n- {選択|せんたく}する: to select — more formal/technical term for choosing an item on screen",
  "schema_version": "2.0",
